Meeting new lifestyle friends with SpicyMatch is as easy as swiping right!

100% discretion & user privacy - YOU ARE IN TOTAL CONTROL

The SpicyMatch App offers the following features:



- Full social media wall and news feed;
- Instant Messager (without the need to give your mobile number out);
- Push Notifications - when someone views your profile, or you receive instant messages, etc;
- Poke, Send & Accept Friends Requests and Like profiles on the fly;
- Speed Dating for immediate hookups & Travel Plans of members travelling to your area;
- Parties, Vacations & Events right near you and all across the world;
- Map for members, shops, clubs, and points of interest, etc near you;
- Extensive advanced Search feature;
- Upload & share your photos directly from your device or use your camera to create new ones. (Photos must be in compliance with the mobile app provider terms. Nudity and/or sexually suggestive pictures will NOT be accepted via App but only via browser).


Regular Updates with new features. Please visit our website for all available features.

Languages supported, English, Spanish, German, French, Dutch, Norwegian, Italian, Finnish, Slovenien, Czech, Romanian, Hungarian, Hebrew & Swedish.
